Themes That Emerged

A recurring theme was community formation around shared interests. Many ideas focused on helping users discover others who consumed the same media and encouraging discussion.

What Surprised Me

That live chat would be much more difficult than a discussion board.

What Feels Unclear

It is unclear how users should discover media and how discussion spaces should be moderated. More research is needed on existing platforms such as Letterboxd, Goodreads, Reddit, and Discord.

